1
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:14,041
I am old.

2
00:00:16,166 --> 00:00:18,666
It's time to step down.

3
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:23,125
This position will go to Fixer Lunar.

4
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:28,083
I doubt
anyone will have a problem with that.

5
00:00:35,166 --> 00:00:38,375
If there are any concerns, state them.

6
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:55,833
This is for chairpersons only.

7
00:00:57,083 --> 00:00:59,375
Why have you brought Fixer Solar in?

8
00:01:00,875 --> 00:01:02,375
Here's the issue.

9
00:01:02,458 --> 00:01:05,875
The successor
to the position of Fixer Celestial,

10
00:01:06,625 --> 00:01:08,416
I truly believe, um,

11
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:10,083
it is not for you to decide.

12
00:01:10,666 --> 00:01:12,625
This is the tradition.

13
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:15,666
How dare you presume to speak about this!

14
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:18,875
Fixer Celestial,
we have discovered recently,

15
00:01:18,958 --> 00:01:21,833
and I say this with the utmost respect,

16
00:01:21,916 --> 00:01:24,416
that the murder of Ching He's Fixer

17
00:01:24,916 --> 00:01:26,708
is connected to you.

18
00:01:27,583 --> 00:01:31,583
So your daughter's appointment
to the position of Fixer Celestial

19
00:01:31,666 --> 00:01:33,000
is now on hold.

20
00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:36,625
Okay.

21
00:01:37,458 --> 00:01:39,541
All of you here

22
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:43,625
have already discussed this in private,
haven't you?

23
00:01:44,125 --> 00:01:45,791
Do you really imagine

24
00:01:46,708 --> 00:01:50,333
that this issue is for me to determine?

25
00:01:55,958 --> 00:02:00,625
I understand that you can't accept this.

26
00:02:01,166 --> 00:02:03,041
Thackery Huang

27
00:02:03,833 --> 00:02:06,041
will never be

28
00:02:06,666 --> 00:02:10,500
the true master of Ching He.

29
00:02:16,541 --> 00:02:18,625
You are.

30
00:02:19,208 --> 00:02:20,916
Oh, Father.

31
00:02:21,958 --> 00:02:25,916
You must take back the position

32
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,458
that belongs to you.

33
00:02:29,416 --> 00:02:31,333
Only you

34
00:02:31,833 --> 00:02:36,208
are qualified to be Fixer Celestial.

35
00:02:36,708 --> 00:02:41,291
Make both sides of the law be afraid.

36
00:02:42,750 --> 00:02:45,375
And make sure they respect you.

37
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:07,458
THE FIXERS

38
00:03:08,708 --> 00:03:12,083
THE FIX

39
00:03:20,041 --> 00:03:21,583
Is anyone home?

40
00:03:22,791 --> 00:03:23,791
I'm back.

41
00:03:30,708 --> 00:03:31,625
Ah.

42
00:03:34,250 --> 00:03:36,458
Lord Guan, I'm sorry.

43
00:03:36,541 --> 00:03:39,375
If I see a pine, with luck,
I'll leave you the cash.

44
00:03:39,458 --> 00:03:40,458
All right? Thanks.

45
00:03:42,583 --> 00:03:44,958
They said
it was a buy-one-get-one-free sale,

46
00:03:45,041 --> 00:03:49,416
so I travel all that way,
and I only get one bag?

47
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:52,166
Oh, why do I do this to myself?
I don't know.

48
00:03:52,875 --> 00:03:54,416
Hmm. Lights.

49
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:57,583
What are you doing in the dark?
Didn't you pray this morning?

50
00:03:57,666 --> 00:03:59,083
Do you have a guilty conscience?

51
00:03:59,166 --> 00:04:02,833
-Praying brings blessings and better luck.
-You better be right about that.

52
00:04:04,333 --> 00:04:06,208
See?

53
00:04:06,291 --> 00:04:08,958
You're sneaking around
just to take a look at your phone.

54
00:04:09,458 --> 00:04:11,208
You're sure you don't have another woman?

55
00:04:11,291 --> 00:04:14,208
You don't have to worry.
Nobody wants an old swamp eel.

56
00:04:14,291 --> 00:04:17,291
You're my second, third, fourth,
and fifth woman.

57
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:19,833
-There's no escaping your clutches.
-Study your father.

58
00:04:19,916 --> 00:04:21,458
So you don't end up like him.

59
00:04:21,541 --> 00:04:23,333
That mouth of his. So smooth.

60
00:04:23,416 --> 00:04:25,791
-On and on and on.
-Well, you chose him.

61
00:04:25,875 --> 00:04:29,000
Hey, I didn't raise you
to talk back to me like that.

62
00:04:30,041 --> 00:04:31,541
Uh, welcome.

63
00:04:32,583 --> 00:04:34,458
Hey, a good dog stays out of the way.

64
00:04:34,541 --> 00:04:35,916
Hey, buddy.

65
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,416
This is all yours.

66
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:38,458
Ta-da.

67
00:04:38,958 --> 00:04:41,625
Oh, I'm sorry
about forcing you to take time off.

68
00:04:41,708 --> 00:04:43,833
Consider this an apology. Huh?

69
00:04:46,250 --> 00:04:47,750
Uh…

70
00:04:50,625 --> 00:04:52,916
-Remember me?
-Pork floss or scallion?

71
00:04:55,166 --> 00:04:57,333
-He's offering you a bun.
-Oh.

72
00:04:57,416 --> 00:04:59,916
Scallion, of course. Love that scallion.

73
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,541
You're very kind. Thank you.

74
00:05:03,333 --> 00:05:07,083
Hey, I gotta say,
this partner of yours is really weird.

75
00:05:07,166 --> 00:05:09,291
Only weirdos can be my partner.

76
00:05:09,375 --> 00:05:11,833
Oh, it is so hard to connect with you.

77
00:05:17,458 --> 00:05:18,875
What's happening with the police?

78
00:05:18,958 --> 00:05:20,041
Welcome.

79
00:05:20,125 --> 00:05:23,166
Come with us to the station.
We need your assistance.

80
00:05:24,416 --> 00:05:27,166
They have no evidence,
so they can't do anything to me.

81
00:05:28,041 --> 00:05:30,291
I'm glad you're all right.
The boss asked about you.

82
00:05:30,375 --> 00:05:31,541
Put it all together.

83
00:05:32,833 --> 00:05:33,666
Okay.

84
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:35,458
I'm not going back.

85
00:05:35,958 --> 00:05:37,208
I'm getting old, man.

86
00:05:37,791 --> 00:05:40,000
I've earned enough money these last years.

87
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:42,583
You're not gonna leave me
with this old fossil.

88
00:05:44,458 --> 00:05:45,666
Hey, I gotta say.

89
00:05:45,750 --> 00:05:48,541
Having such a difficult partner
is hard work.

90
00:05:50,666 --> 00:05:51,500
He's bashful.

91
00:05:51,583 --> 00:05:52,416
-Look.
-Mm.

92
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:55,250
-He's got a sharp tongue but a soft heart.
-Oh yes, I know.

93
00:05:55,333 --> 00:05:58,125
Sharp tongue, heart of the girl,
nostrils huge, and eyes like pearls.

94
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:01,541
-If anything comes up, call Ching He.
-Yeah.

95
00:06:02,125 --> 00:06:03,041
-You're paying.
-Huh?

96
00:06:04,083 --> 00:06:07,000
Uh, for these two, that's 40.

97
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:09,208
-This is a hundred.
-Buddy. Hey, buddy.

98
00:06:09,291 --> 00:06:11,625
-No need to do that. It's all right.
-Hey. No, I…

99
00:06:11,708 --> 00:06:14,000
No, no. No need.

100
00:06:14,083 --> 00:06:16,083
-Hey, you're back.
-Yes, we're home.

101
00:06:16,166 --> 00:06:19,250
-Here. Hey, give it to me.
-This backpack's so heavy. Here.

102
00:06:19,333 --> 00:06:22,000
-Oh. Hey. What's in there?
-Thank you. Let me see your hands.

103
00:06:23,875 --> 00:06:26,583
So Noods and Shadow, who reported that?

104
00:06:26,666 --> 00:06:29,041
Hey. Just to get this out of the way.
I didn't do it.

105
00:06:29,708 --> 00:06:32,916
Fixers Expunge and Annul
would have cleaned up the scene.

106
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Logically, there'd be nothing to show.

107
00:06:35,083 --> 00:06:36,250
Should we investigate?

108
00:06:36,333 --> 00:06:39,041
No, I've already sent people to do that.

109
00:06:40,041 --> 00:06:42,375
The request this time is delicate.

110
00:06:45,416 --> 00:06:48,083
The client is Hsiu of San He.

111
00:06:48,666 --> 00:06:51,958
He's the right-hand man
of the association leader Lin Wan-li.

112
00:06:52,458 --> 00:06:54,250
Lin Wan-li is currently missing,

113
00:06:54,333 --> 00:06:55,666
but a witness reported

114
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:58,583
they saw Hsiu's subordinates
kidnapping him.

115
00:06:59,166 --> 00:07:00,916
Hsiu denies he was involved.

116
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,958
He suspects Lin Kuei-pin is behind it all.

117
00:07:10,250 --> 00:07:13,875
Lin Wan-li, the leader of San He,
was kidnapped.

118
00:07:15,208 --> 00:07:16,250
I heard.

119
00:07:16,333 --> 00:07:19,333
Wasn't it Lin Wan-li's deputy, Hsiu,
who did it?

120
00:07:19,833 --> 00:07:22,583
If all San He's members start brawling,

121
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:25,208
are you ready for your next move?

122
00:07:26,166 --> 00:07:30,083
Do you mean his rival, Lin Kuei-pin?

123
00:07:30,166 --> 00:07:32,166
Lin Wan-li is not young.

124
00:07:32,666 --> 00:07:36,166
Word on the street is there are two people
gunning for his position.

125
00:07:36,708 --> 00:07:39,916
One is Lin Wan-li's younger brother,
Lin Kuei-pin.

126
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,083
Ah, get in!

127
00:07:41,583 --> 00:07:43,708
The other is Hsiu.

128
00:07:44,208 --> 00:07:46,000
One of them is like a hawk.

129
00:07:46,083 --> 00:07:47,833
The other, like a dove.

130
00:07:47,916 --> 00:07:49,458
They've always been at odds.

131
00:07:51,041 --> 00:07:52,500
Hey.

132
00:07:52,583 --> 00:07:54,791
Don't run up here.

133
00:07:56,583 --> 00:07:59,958
All your brothers are still down there.
Where's your sense of loyalty?

134
00:08:01,583 --> 00:08:04,166
How are you gonna face boss Hsiu,
you coward?

135
00:08:04,250 --> 00:08:06,208
-After Lin Wan-li went missing…
-Fuck!

136
00:08:06,291 --> 00:08:08,833
…Ling Kuei-pin began making moves
on Hsiu's territory.

137
00:08:08,916 --> 00:08:11,625
He's calling for him
to release his brother.

138
00:08:11,708 --> 00:08:15,416
I can't imagine that this guy won't jump
at the chance to make a move.

139
00:08:16,916 --> 00:08:21,041
The current mayor's so-called
"capital of happiness and excellence"

140
00:08:21,125 --> 00:08:23,416
is now a haven for organized crime.

141
00:08:24,041 --> 00:08:25,875
Journalists have a new headline.

142
00:08:26,375 --> 00:08:28,416
Shall we help to push this along?

143
00:08:36,666 --> 00:08:38,333
Tell your boss, Hsiu,

144
00:08:38,416 --> 00:08:42,041
that every day he holds my brother,
I'll be here to pay my respects.

145
00:08:43,166 --> 00:08:44,625
Lin Kuei-pin!

146
00:08:45,291 --> 00:08:46,291
Have you gone insane?

147
00:08:48,458 --> 00:08:50,333
Why are you causing trouble here?

148
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:55,291
-You know what you've done.
-You think my men kidnapped Lin Wan-li?

149
00:08:55,375 --> 00:08:57,416
If you won't tell the truth,

150
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,625
you're going to cop the flak.

151
00:09:03,083 --> 00:09:03,916
Right!

152
00:09:10,458 --> 00:09:12,541
They are San He members, after all.

153
00:09:12,625 --> 00:09:14,958
Hsiu doesn't want both sides
to destroy each other…

154
00:09:15,041 --> 00:09:17,041
San He has the power it has…

155
00:09:17,125 --> 00:09:20,125
…which is why
he especially commissioned Ching He

156
00:09:20,208 --> 00:09:22,208
to help find Lin Wan-li.

157
00:09:22,916 --> 00:09:25,958
This could also be proof
that Lin Wan-li's disappearance

158
00:09:26,041 --> 00:09:27,875
has nothing to do with Hsiu.

159
00:09:31,375 --> 00:09:32,666
I can't take this one.

160
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:37,583
No fixer has ever dared
to refuse a case assigned by Ching He.

161
00:09:38,916 --> 00:09:40,916
You used to work for San He.

162
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,791
You know how they operate.

163
00:09:42,875 --> 00:09:44,750
You're best placed for this job.

164
00:09:48,541 --> 00:09:49,750
I still can't take it.

165
00:09:50,250 --> 00:09:51,500
Find someone else.

166
00:09:52,291 --> 00:09:54,958
Have you forgotten
the rules of the Fixers?

167
00:10:02,958 --> 00:10:05,333
Don't worry. We'll deal with it.

168
00:10:17,375 --> 00:10:20,541
Why won't you do it?
You got a grudge against San He?

169
00:10:21,375 --> 00:10:23,250
Don't ask. It's part of my past.

170
00:10:23,333 --> 00:10:26,291
Just like I don't ask
about your business either.

171
00:10:26,375 --> 00:10:27,291
Get it?

172
00:11:05,375 --> 00:11:08,208
TRUTH IS STRANGER THAN FICTION

173
00:11:17,250 --> 00:11:20,041
All around, mountains and waters combine.

174
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:26,416
Let's see if you're that divine.

175
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:29,333
Divine, huh? Master of pen and gun.

176
00:11:29,416 --> 00:11:31,250
You're the most cultured in all of San He.

177
00:11:31,333 --> 00:11:32,166
Ah.

178
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:35,541
I, Chen Liang-chi,
was meant to hold a pen.

179
00:11:35,625 --> 00:11:37,166
Now I carry a gun.

180
00:11:37,666 --> 00:11:41,458
And so I… I will definitely
send my daughter abroad to study.

181
00:11:41,541 --> 00:11:44,125
The world will be her oyster.

182
00:11:44,208 --> 00:11:46,083
Nice, nice.

183
00:11:46,166 --> 00:11:48,250
-Your turn, your turn.
-Okay, I'll go. Give it here.

184
00:11:50,041 --> 00:11:51,250
And…

185
00:11:52,333 --> 00:11:53,375
Water.

186
00:11:54,875 --> 00:11:56,333
Combine.

187
00:11:57,041 --> 00:11:58,916
Ooh.

188
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,458
Will you look at that?

189
00:12:00,541 --> 00:12:02,625
Your two months of practice
beat my two years.

190
00:12:02,708 --> 00:12:04,500
-Ah.
-You on Viagra?

191
00:12:04,583 --> 00:12:06,666
Come on, this is nothing.

192
00:12:06,750 --> 00:12:09,375
Give me another two months.
I could hit a fly, I bet you.

193
00:12:09,458 --> 00:12:11,583
-Well, that is incredible.
-Uh-huh.

194
00:12:11,666 --> 00:12:15,583
Okay, okay. In two years, we'll arrange
a fly-shooting contest for Boss Wan.

195
00:12:15,666 --> 00:12:17,916
You'll quickly rise up the ranks.

196
00:12:18,458 --> 00:12:22,083
Hail to the chief
who rises to power by killing insects.

197
00:12:23,541 --> 00:12:25,958
Candlelight glows on an autumn night.

198
00:12:27,666 --> 00:12:28,750
Autumn.

199
00:12:30,833 --> 00:12:32,958
Rise to power by killing insects.

200
00:12:35,625 --> 00:12:38,291
I'm Chief Fly. Hail to the Chief Fly.

201
00:12:46,333 --> 00:12:49,541
NOTHING IS SO BEAUTIFUL AS SPRING

202
00:12:53,666 --> 00:12:55,833
SPRING

203
00:13:12,291 --> 00:13:13,125
Looking for me?

204
00:13:15,083 --> 00:13:16,750
What have you been up to lately?

205
00:13:19,833 --> 00:13:22,291
Being the youngest son
of a political dynasty

206
00:13:22,375 --> 00:13:25,500
who obeys his father
and knows how to keep a very low profile.

207
00:13:28,083 --> 00:13:29,416
What's with the attitude?

208
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:31,708
You can't talk to Dad like that.

209
00:13:32,333 --> 00:13:33,375
You're scolding me.

210
00:13:33,458 --> 00:13:36,666
I want you
at this year's ancestor worship ceremony.

211
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:39,500
All the major media outlets will be there.

212
00:13:39,583 --> 00:13:42,208
You can learn how to handle these things
from your brother.

213
00:13:42,708 --> 00:13:45,083
Spend time with him.
Watch and learn. You understand?

214
00:13:45,166 --> 00:13:46,333
As his puppet?

215
00:13:46,416 --> 00:13:48,166
You're a member of the Hsueh family.

216
00:13:48,250 --> 00:13:51,375
-Stop all this idling, and--
-Oh, so I am a Hsueh?

217
00:13:52,708 --> 00:13:55,791
You won't be embarrassed
if your other son's in public?

218
00:13:56,375 --> 00:13:58,208
Just do what I tell you.

219
00:13:58,958 --> 00:14:02,000
If you really don't wanna go,
then please don't.

220
00:14:20,375 --> 00:14:23,500
Dad only did this
because he wants to fix things with you.

221
00:14:24,541 --> 00:14:27,416
Whatever I do,
it's never good enough for him.

222
00:14:28,666 --> 00:14:30,125
Don't let me drag you down.

223
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:37,458
Don't you want to win his approval?

224
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:41,416
Dad would always like you to help out.

225
00:14:43,250 --> 00:14:44,291
I would too.

226
00:14:45,625 --> 00:14:48,916
I need a guy I can really trust
to help me out.

227
00:14:51,458 --> 00:14:56,166
Your read on people and situations
is always second to none.

228
00:14:56,250 --> 00:14:57,333
You're a natural.

229
00:14:58,125 --> 00:14:59,541
I want Dad to see that.

230
00:15:42,833 --> 00:15:45,208
DADDY NOT HERE?

231
00:15:51,958 --> 00:15:55,083
ARE YOU ALONE?

232
00:15:56,625 --> 00:15:57,541
Sorry.

233
00:15:58,125 --> 00:16:00,875
I was tidying up in the back.
Sorry to keep you waiting.

234
00:16:01,500 --> 00:16:04,166
-Um, that will be 100.
-Hmm.

235
00:16:04,250 --> 00:16:06,375
The bread's half price
because it's end of the day.

236
00:16:06,458 --> 00:16:07,666
Thank you.

237
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:08,916
He's very well behaved.

238
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,666
Yes. Here.

239
00:16:27,416 --> 00:16:28,875
Ah, you're back.

240
00:16:29,875 --> 00:16:30,875
Hiya.

241
00:16:37,625 --> 00:16:41,333
DADDY NOT HERE? ARE YOU ALONE?

242
00:16:44,875 --> 00:16:46,416
THE WAY OF THREE HARMONIES

243
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:48,458
No one needs to know
I met with the police,

244
00:16:48,541 --> 00:16:50,708
so please don't tell anyone.

245
00:16:50,791 --> 00:16:52,791
Our identity is sensitive, after all.

246
00:16:52,875 --> 00:16:53,958
I understand.

247
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,416
Has Lin Wan-li made any enemies lately?

248
00:16:57,916 --> 00:17:01,250
He's getting close to retirement.
All he wants is peace.

249
00:17:01,333 --> 00:17:03,416
He never wants conflict with anyone now.

250
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,083
A-wan had already made arrangements.

251
00:17:07,166 --> 00:17:09,125
He knew he wasn't getting any younger.

252
00:17:09,208 --> 00:17:11,500
He wrote up his will a little while ago.

253
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:15,666
Word on the street
is that Lin Wan-li's kidnapping this time

254
00:17:15,750 --> 00:17:17,666
is connected to Hsiu and Lin Kuei-pin.

255
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:18,875
I don't believe it.

256
00:17:18,958 --> 00:17:22,250
Pin's his younger brother,
and Hsiu was a close associate.

257
00:17:22,333 --> 00:17:23,625
Yu.

258
00:17:24,625 --> 00:17:26,166
I heard the cops were here.

259
00:17:26,833 --> 00:17:28,375
How come you didn't tell me?

260
00:17:28,958 --> 00:17:30,208
I didn't have time.

261
00:17:32,208 --> 00:17:33,625
So, officer,

262
00:17:34,583 --> 00:17:35,958
why have you come here?

263
00:17:36,458 --> 00:17:39,625
A-pin, the police are here
to help find your brother.

264
00:17:39,708 --> 00:17:40,875
What's your unit?

265
00:17:41,666 --> 00:17:43,333
Who sent you here?

266
00:17:51,208 --> 00:17:53,041
A-wan? A-wan, it's me.

267
00:17:54,666 --> 00:17:56,541
What's that sound? Hello?

268
00:17:57,083 --> 00:17:58,666
Put it on speaker.

269
00:17:58,750 --> 00:18:00,875
A-wan?

270
00:18:02,166 --> 00:18:03,000
A-wan?

271
00:18:03,083 --> 00:18:06,750
In three days, get on the bus.
The ransom is one million dollars.

272
00:18:06,833 --> 00:18:09,458
Only Lin Wan-li's wife can board the bus.

273
00:18:09,541 --> 00:18:13,250
If we find out anyone's following her,
we'll kill him immediately.

274
00:18:13,333 --> 00:18:15,416
Hey, can you let me--

275
00:18:17,041 --> 00:18:18,375
Did I hear that right?

276
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,958
Ransom of one million bucks.

277
00:18:21,833 --> 00:18:22,666
Shit.

278
00:18:23,500 --> 00:18:25,250
That's a fucking insult.

279
00:18:25,333 --> 00:18:29,000
We recommend you do nothing for now.
Leave it up to the police.

280
00:18:29,083 --> 00:18:31,458
We'll look after this one.
It's a family concern.

281
00:18:31,541 --> 00:18:33,208
-The police can stay out of it.
-A-pin.

282
00:18:33,291 --> 00:18:35,458
This will only make things harder
for your brother.

283
00:18:35,958 --> 00:18:36,791
He should go.

284
00:18:37,541 --> 00:18:39,000
Come with me, officer.

285
00:18:52,291 --> 00:18:55,041
HUNG HSING BAKERY

286
00:18:55,125 --> 00:18:58,208
Well, that's weird.
Why'd he close up so early?

287
00:18:59,958 --> 00:19:01,875
He hasn't put anything away.

288
00:19:45,083 --> 00:19:47,208
HU TUNG-YU, FIXER SHADOW, AGE 43

289
00:19:47,291 --> 00:19:50,000
STATUS: DECEASED

290
00:19:57,291 --> 00:20:00,041
Agent Terra,
what brings you here to see me?

291
00:20:01,333 --> 00:20:03,833
Some things can't be discussed
over the phone.

292
00:20:05,166 --> 00:20:06,958
We've been friends a long time,

293
00:20:07,041 --> 00:20:09,208
and there's something
I need to warn you about.

294
00:20:10,375 --> 00:20:14,875
Are you here to talk about the rumors
circulating about Ching He

295
00:20:15,375 --> 00:20:18,583
that we leaked to the police,
internal secrets,

296
00:20:19,083 --> 00:20:22,083
that we're planning
to have our own fixers knocked off?

297
00:20:24,333 --> 00:20:26,875
It's not just us who've heard this.

298
00:20:27,625 --> 00:20:30,166
Our clients have heard it as well.

299
00:20:30,666 --> 00:20:33,583
We had several clients
who wanted to commission us.

300
00:20:33,666 --> 00:20:36,833
And in the last few days,
they all canceled.

301
00:20:37,416 --> 00:20:40,916
Someone out there
is obviously rumor-mongering,

302
00:20:41,500 --> 00:20:43,750
but that's no reason for us to worry.

303
00:20:44,250 --> 00:20:48,041
If clients feel
they can't keep their information private,

304
00:20:48,875 --> 00:20:51,708
they could turn on Ching He at any time.

305
00:20:57,541 --> 00:20:59,625
Three make a tiger.

306
00:20:59,708 --> 00:21:02,083
A lie told often enough becomes the truth.

307
00:21:03,416 --> 00:21:04,500
Don't forget.

308
00:21:04,583 --> 00:21:06,958
When some people lose something,

309
00:21:07,625 --> 00:21:09,666
all they want then is to own it.

310
00:21:12,166 --> 00:21:16,875
Sir, Tristan is achieving
huge approval ratings.

311
00:21:17,791 --> 00:21:20,666
The position of mayor
is well within his reach.

312
00:21:21,166 --> 00:21:23,125
All thanks to you, Madam Fan.

313
00:21:23,208 --> 00:21:26,291
We're grateful to Yeh Yueh Tong
for helping this time.

314
00:21:26,375 --> 00:21:29,291
It's you who gave us the chance
to prove that.

315
00:21:29,375 --> 00:21:34,083
What Ching He does well,
Yeh Yueh Tong does equally.

316
00:21:34,583 --> 00:21:37,458
And we can outshine them.

317
00:21:37,541 --> 00:21:40,958
I heard that Ching He's
been having some trouble lately.

318
00:21:41,833 --> 00:21:46,208
Thackeray Huang's
working methods will only harm Ching He.

319
00:21:46,708 --> 00:21:49,416
To ensure that Ching He continues,

320
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:52,166
the temple needs a whole new leader.

321
00:21:54,458 --> 00:21:58,291
It sounds as if you've got some ideas.

322
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,500
Ching He Temple
is the organization's backbone.

323
00:22:02,583 --> 00:22:05,916
The old guard wants to maintain
a position of neutrality.

324
00:22:06,416 --> 00:22:08,458
Those days are gone.

325
00:22:08,541 --> 00:22:10,333
It needs to live in the light

326
00:22:10,916 --> 00:22:12,583
and partly in shadow.

327
00:22:13,250 --> 00:22:17,000
For the light side,
the Hsueh family is the most qualified.

328
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:19,708
For the shadow, let me handle it.

329
00:22:20,833 --> 00:22:25,291
As long as we're in tune,
the world will be at our feet.

330
00:22:26,458 --> 00:22:28,875
You want to take over Ching He.

331
00:22:29,375 --> 00:22:33,000
I only want returned
what rightfully belongs to me.

332
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,250
Oh, I see.

333
00:22:38,625 --> 00:22:41,458
How about you give me one week?

334
00:22:41,958 --> 00:22:46,083
After that,
I will give you a satisfactory answer.

335
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,083
Here.

336
00:22:49,166 --> 00:22:52,083
We used to play chess, you and I.
What do you say?

337
00:22:52,166 --> 00:22:53,333
Would you like a game?

338
00:22:53,416 --> 00:22:54,666
Maybe next time.

339
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:57,083
I still have some things to take care of.

340
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,333
You and I.

341
00:23:00,416 --> 00:23:02,458
We'll be seeing each other presently.

342
00:23:11,083 --> 00:23:13,375
It seems it's not just Fixer Terra.

343
00:23:13,875 --> 00:23:16,666
Earth, Arcane, Cosmos,
and Eon are also worried.

344
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:18,541
Now management knows of it.

345
00:23:19,541 --> 00:23:21,541
We have to sort this out fast.

346
00:23:21,625 --> 00:23:23,541
Invite Hsiu here.

347
00:23:24,083 --> 00:23:28,666
Say that our services
will be free of charge

348
00:23:29,583 --> 00:23:33,625
in the hope that they might do something
for Ching He.

349
00:23:34,833 --> 00:23:37,583
If you fail to take over Ching He,

350
00:23:37,666 --> 00:23:39,083
and Ching He turns on you…

351
00:23:41,500 --> 00:23:43,708
…then that's a considerable risk.

352
00:23:44,208 --> 00:23:45,958
Sir, have you heard

353
00:23:46,041 --> 00:23:49,458
that Ching He
has a set of classified files

354
00:23:49,541 --> 00:23:52,083
that could upturn
the whole political order?

355
00:23:52,166 --> 00:23:53,291
I've heard that.

356
00:23:53,375 --> 00:23:55,375
It's the cornerstone
that's allowed Ching He

357
00:23:55,458 --> 00:23:57,333
to remain neutral all this time.

358
00:23:59,541 --> 00:24:02,208
These special files are definitely there.

359
00:24:02,291 --> 00:24:07,083
They are known as the Primordial Files.

360
00:24:07,166 --> 00:24:11,416
Agent Primordium is the most elite Fixer
in the history of Ching He.

361
00:24:11,916 --> 00:24:15,666
They handle classified requests
of the utmost delicacy.

362
00:24:15,750 --> 00:24:19,666
Only the successive heads of Ching He know
where they're hidden.

363
00:24:20,250 --> 00:24:23,291
Except for Thackeray Huang.
He has no idea.

364
00:24:24,458 --> 00:24:26,250
And yet, I do.

365
00:24:27,916 --> 00:24:31,166
If you support me
in dealing with Thackeray Huang,

366
00:24:31,666 --> 00:24:35,916
both sides of the law
will be under our control.

367
00:24:37,791 --> 00:24:40,291
You'll never have
a more influential supporter.

368
00:24:46,708 --> 00:24:49,666
This bridge
connects both sides of the city.

369
00:24:51,500 --> 00:24:54,541
One side represents order and power.

370
00:24:55,458 --> 00:24:59,250
The other side embodies ambition
and opportunity.

371
00:25:00,458 --> 00:25:02,125
They're not in opposition.

372
00:25:05,333 --> 00:25:06,708
They coexist.

373
00:25:16,458 --> 00:25:18,791
THREE-IN-ONE COMBO, AMAZING VALUE

374
00:25:19,791 --> 00:25:21,250
TWENTY MILLION DOLLARS ONLY

375
00:25:21,333 --> 00:25:24,000
I don't know
if your husband ever told you what I do.

376
00:25:24,083 --> 00:25:24,916
Before he died,

377
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,875
he bought a life insurance policy
from our company.

378
00:25:27,958 --> 00:25:30,125
This is what he left
for you and your child.

379
00:25:30,666 --> 00:25:32,708
We hope it helps at this difficult time.

380
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:39,166
He was like that.

381
00:25:39,250 --> 00:25:41,208
Refused to tell me anything.

382
00:25:41,291 --> 00:25:42,875
Never shared his burdens.

383
00:25:42,958 --> 00:25:44,125
I don't want this.

384
00:25:45,875 --> 00:25:47,333
I just want him back.

385
00:25:51,375 --> 00:25:54,583
Uh… we're sorry for your loss.

386
00:25:58,625 --> 00:26:02,541
I know that money isn't part
of an insurance payout.

387
00:26:06,666 --> 00:26:07,875
Thanks anyway.

388
00:26:14,458 --> 00:26:15,833
I'm very sorry.

389
00:26:28,416 --> 00:26:29,625
It's my fault.

390
00:26:30,291 --> 00:26:32,083
If I hadn't shot and injured him…

391
00:26:33,125 --> 00:26:34,416
…he'd still be alive.

392
00:26:34,916 --> 00:26:37,541
Hm, don't flatter yourself.

393
00:26:38,333 --> 00:26:41,833
Fixers take risks.
It's all in the job description.

394
00:26:42,791 --> 00:26:44,666
We've laid Shadow to rest.

395
00:26:44,750 --> 00:26:47,291
The rest is down to Fixer Expunge
and the others.

396
00:26:47,791 --> 00:26:48,750
Hmm.

397
00:26:49,708 --> 00:26:52,500
Hey. I thought the cleaning was done now.

398
00:26:53,333 --> 00:26:56,791
When a fixer dies,
their partner brings their body back.

399
00:26:56,875 --> 00:27:00,916
Then Fixer Expunge erases all records
that link the agent to Ching He.

400
00:27:02,750 --> 00:27:04,791
I wish they could erase memories.

401
00:27:09,666 --> 00:27:10,666
Mm.

402
00:27:14,416 --> 00:27:17,541
Hey, how's the San He case going?

403
00:27:17,625 --> 00:27:19,708
You don't care about San He.

404
00:27:19,791 --> 00:27:23,916
You're right, I don't care about San He,
but I do care about my partner.

405
00:27:27,250 --> 00:27:31,083
Oh. Uh, I accidentally hurt my hand
during the mission.

406
00:27:31,166 --> 00:27:33,833
It'll get better soon, I'm sure.

407
00:27:34,416 --> 00:27:36,541
Lin Kuei-pin's got Hsiu in his sights.

408
00:27:37,041 --> 00:27:39,791
I'd say he's going to act
before the cash is handed over.

409
00:27:59,041 --> 00:28:00,958
This current gang war

410
00:28:01,041 --> 00:28:03,708
highlights the mayor's total incompetence.

411
00:28:07,625 --> 00:28:10,958
The city of happiness
is now a city of gangsters.

412
00:28:11,041 --> 00:28:13,875
Mayor, come out. We deserve an apology.

413
00:28:13,958 --> 00:28:16,000
Go fuck yourself, Lin Kuei-pin.

414
00:28:16,500 --> 00:28:18,166
TRAITOR

415
00:28:18,250 --> 00:28:21,166
Don't neglect your duties
in the twilight of your term.

416
00:28:21,250 --> 00:28:25,541
Continue to safeguard
the safety of your constituents.

417
00:28:40,875 --> 00:28:43,500
Next stop,
Nanjing and Longjiang intersection.

418
00:28:43,583 --> 00:28:46,416
I said wear a disguise,
not that we're catching trout.

419
00:28:47,125 --> 00:28:50,083
A disguise is all about the detail.

420
00:28:50,166 --> 00:28:52,875
As the saying goes,
Grand Duke Jiang fishes for crooks,

421
00:28:52,958 --> 00:28:54,250
and the willing take the line.

422
00:28:54,333 --> 00:28:56,000
What about you
wearing sunglasses at night?

423
00:28:56,083 --> 00:28:57,583
Can you even see anything?

424
00:29:27,083 --> 00:29:28,166
You again.

425
00:29:30,333 --> 00:29:31,708
What's the deal now?

426
00:29:31,791 --> 00:29:34,333
Is Yeh Yueh Tong
poaching all the temple's cases?

427
00:29:34,416 --> 00:29:37,208
Our target is the same. Lin Wan-li.

428
00:29:37,708 --> 00:29:39,541
It's not about Yeh Yueh Tong.

429
00:29:40,791 --> 00:29:43,708
And tell me, are you fine?
Us working together?

430
00:29:44,333 --> 00:29:46,333
-I'm okay.
-Who cares?

431
00:29:52,708 --> 00:29:54,375
-Hello.
-Did you bring money?

432
00:29:54,875 --> 00:29:56,250
I'm gonna get it from you now.

433
00:29:57,125 --> 00:29:58,291
Where are you?

434
00:29:58,375 --> 00:30:01,583
At the next stop,
toss the money out the back door.

435
00:30:02,083 --> 00:30:03,458
Don't get off the bus.

436
00:30:03,541 --> 00:30:05,791
If you miss the stop,
your husband will die.

437
00:30:24,833 --> 00:30:26,125
Stop running, motherfucker.

438
00:30:26,208 --> 00:30:27,583
Don't chase 'em.

439
00:30:29,833 --> 00:30:31,666
I placed a tracker in there.

440
00:30:35,666 --> 00:30:38,333
-Hey, we did it! We did it.
-What?

441
00:30:38,416 --> 00:30:40,750
-Got the million dollars.
-You got the money.

442
00:30:40,833 --> 00:30:42,000
Where's the money? Let me see.

443
00:30:42,083 --> 00:30:44,833
Good thing I'm a fast runner,
or I could've got killed.

444
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,000
Take this roast duck

445
00:30:52,083 --> 00:30:54,208
and pay your respects
to the God of Wealth.

446
00:30:54,291 --> 00:30:55,250
Go on.

447
00:30:59,666 --> 00:31:00,958
Dun, da, da, da, da!

448
00:31:01,458 --> 00:31:03,291
God of Wealth, it's time to eat.

449
00:31:03,791 --> 00:31:07,541
Why are you teasing me like this?
I've already seen your face.

450
00:31:10,416 --> 00:31:12,458
You're joking. You can see my face?

451
00:31:12,541 --> 00:31:14,250
Well, I can see your asshole.

452
00:31:14,791 --> 00:31:16,041
Nice.

453
00:31:16,125 --> 00:31:19,125
Your hair's dyed a kind of straw color.

454
00:31:19,625 --> 00:31:20,750
Am I right?

455
00:31:21,666 --> 00:31:23,250
What?

456
00:31:24,500 --> 00:31:27,125
-Hey, he saw me, he saw me!
-What's up, huh?

457
00:31:27,208 --> 00:31:29,000
-What are you saying?
-He saw me. Saw my face.

458
00:31:29,083 --> 00:31:31,166
He saw you?
I told you not to use a garbage bag.

459
00:31:31,250 --> 00:31:33,708
Have you kidnapped anyone before?

460
00:31:34,416 --> 00:31:37,250
Did you really only ask
for one million dollars?

461
00:31:38,041 --> 00:31:41,625
Do you think I'm that cheap… or San He?

462
00:31:42,125 --> 00:31:43,125
-Huh?
-San He?

463
00:31:43,208 --> 00:31:45,083
-What's this San He thing?
-How should I know?

464
00:31:45,166 --> 00:31:48,041
-San He. San He, what is that?
-I'm Lin Wan-li.

465
00:31:48,541 --> 00:31:50,125
You got a phone, right?

466
00:31:50,625 --> 00:31:52,458
-Who's Lin Wan-li?
-Google it.

467
00:32:06,166 --> 00:32:07,250
Hey.

468
00:32:07,333 --> 00:32:09,833
-Well, is he? Is it him?
-Yes. Yes.

469
00:32:10,333 --> 00:32:12,250
-Fuck!
-Stop. Stop, hey.

470
00:32:13,125 --> 00:32:15,750
Of all the people we could kidnap,
why did we kidnap the San He guy?

471
00:32:15,833 --> 00:32:18,416
Just shut up for a second.
I'll figure it out.

472
00:32:18,500 --> 00:32:21,416
This is how we've always done it.
You're the muscle, I'm the brains.

473
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:22,875
-Okay?
-I'm hungry.

474
00:32:23,625 --> 00:32:26,541
You get me a good feed,
I won't rat you out.

475
00:32:27,541 --> 00:32:29,958
He says he's hungry. What should we do?

476
00:32:39,958 --> 00:32:42,375
Sir, have a duck leg.

477
00:32:44,166 --> 00:32:45,208
Okay.

478
00:32:47,250 --> 00:32:49,625
What's the deal with you guys?

479
00:32:49,708 --> 00:32:52,875
How'd you wind up
with the kidnap plan, huh?

480
00:32:55,041 --> 00:32:57,333
We lost all our money playing poker.

481
00:32:57,416 --> 00:32:58,583
Now we're in debt.

482
00:32:58,666 --> 00:33:01,875
If we don't pay,
we'll lose the rest of our fingers.

483
00:33:02,458 --> 00:33:04,541
How long have you two known each other?

484
00:33:05,041 --> 00:33:06,875
We've hung out since we were kids.

485
00:33:06,958 --> 00:33:08,041
-Uh-huh.
-We're good friends.

486
00:33:08,125 --> 00:33:09,041
Ah.

487
00:33:10,916 --> 00:33:13,375
Uh, looking at you two,

488
00:33:14,166 --> 00:33:17,375
I'm reminded of two young men
who used to follow me.

489
00:33:17,875 --> 00:33:19,625
They were a lot like you two.

490
00:33:20,833 --> 00:33:22,958
They were a lot smarter than you.

491
00:33:23,041 --> 00:33:24,458
They were cunning.

492
00:33:24,541 --> 00:33:25,375
Huh?

493
00:33:25,458 --> 00:33:29,625
In my whole life, I've never met two guys
as thick as you are.

494
00:33:30,833 --> 00:33:32,291
He's right, you are.

495
00:33:32,375 --> 00:33:37,500
Uh… when I think of the days
when they would follow me around,

496
00:33:38,958 --> 00:33:41,208
they were the best days of my life.

497
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:42,958
Hmm.

498
00:33:45,166 --> 00:33:47,041
Did you only speak to my wife?

499
00:33:47,125 --> 00:33:49,416
What about the other gang members?

500
00:33:51,041 --> 00:33:53,291
-Did you?
-Uh, no.

501
00:33:57,416 --> 00:33:59,833
Tomorrow, I'll leave the mountain,

502
00:34:00,583 --> 00:34:03,541
and I'll tell them I staged everything.

503
00:34:04,125 --> 00:34:06,125
And that way, you'll be fine.

504
00:34:06,208 --> 00:34:09,166
You can go pay off your gambling debts.

505
00:34:09,958 --> 00:34:13,583
Once that's settled,
you work for me, all right?

506
00:34:14,250 --> 00:34:15,750
-Really? Boss!
-Hey.

507
00:34:15,833 --> 00:34:17,708
Hey, call him "boss." Call him "boss."

508
00:34:17,791 --> 00:34:18,791
-Boss.
-Boss.

509
00:34:18,875 --> 00:34:20,666
Ah…

510
00:34:20,750 --> 00:34:22,208
Uh, reporting in, boss.

511
00:34:22,291 --> 00:34:23,666
Nature calls.

512
00:34:23,750 --> 00:34:25,458
-I'm going for a piss now.
-Yeah.

513
00:34:25,541 --> 00:34:27,416
-Go on, go.
-Okay.

514
00:34:27,500 --> 00:34:28,500
Uh-huh.

515
00:34:28,583 --> 00:34:29,750
-You sit.
-All right.

516
00:34:30,250 --> 00:34:31,125
Here.

517
00:35:00,333 --> 00:35:01,375
What's that?

518
00:35:14,541 --> 00:35:16,250
Am I being rescued?

519
00:35:21,916 --> 00:35:22,875
Hmm?

520
00:35:24,875 --> 00:35:27,125
Or am I being assassinated?

521
00:35:27,708 --> 00:35:31,291
Boss Wan, we're just here to see you off.

522
00:35:33,166 --> 00:35:34,375
A-pin?

523
00:35:35,166 --> 00:35:36,500
That coward.

524
00:35:36,583 --> 00:35:40,541
He should kill me himself,
but he doesn't have the guts.

525
00:35:44,458 --> 00:35:45,625
I'm sorry.

526
00:35:47,041 --> 00:35:49,125
Sharing this last meal,

527
00:35:50,250 --> 00:35:51,708
it was a joy.

528
00:36:05,041 --> 00:36:06,375
Boss Wan-li,

529
00:36:07,416 --> 00:36:08,875
I'm very sorry.

530
00:37:06,791 --> 00:37:08,250
Lin Wan-li.

531
00:38:11,875 --> 00:38:13,125
Who would have thought?

532
00:38:14,125 --> 00:38:17,291
You and I meeting again after so long.

533
00:38:25,958 --> 00:38:28,583
Hang in there. Boss Wan will be here soon.

534
00:38:33,916 --> 00:38:37,458
Hang in there. It'll be fine.
Just hang in there. Do you hear me?

535
00:38:37,541 --> 00:38:38,541
You'll be fine.

536
00:38:38,625 --> 00:38:40,750
They are not coming. Just go.

537
00:38:48,666 --> 00:38:49,875
Yeah.

538
00:38:49,958 --> 00:38:52,041
Hello, Fixer Fortune.

539
00:38:52,541 --> 00:38:53,666
What's going on?

540
00:38:55,500 --> 00:38:57,500
You remember the rule I told you?

541
00:39:00,541 --> 00:39:02,416
When a fixer dies…

542
00:39:04,458 --> 00:39:06,666
their partner has to collect the body.
